            "answer": "<p>No. The panels are 12 mm tempered safety glass, the same type used in shower doors. Heat and UV do not cloud or weaken it. In Encino, Woodland Hills or Pasadena the railing sits in full sun all afternoon. The glass stays clear and carries a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. The hardware is 2205 stainless steel in Brushed Stainless or Matte Black.</p>",
            "pages": ""
